00:17:36.000 --> 00:18:07.000
that you should have been getting over the last couple of decades or more, actually. But they're also even taking funds out of, or they're reducing their contribution to your retirement money. So employer contributions to retirement have also gone down in the last couple of decades again because of rising healthcare costs. Now insurance companies are incentivized to reduce care and limit costs, but it's what pointing out here. The goal here is not to limit care that is needed.

