who comes into the ER. You think 99.9% probability that that headache is just a regular headache and is not a brain tumor. But, you know, there is some risk of a lawsuit, for example, and the family is anxious again, they might have the expectation that we will do something, and oh, by the way, the hospital will make a couple of thousand dollars

