00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:54.000
if we do a brain MRI. It's pretty easy to lean towards getting extra images and extra studies performed. And those actually don't come without risk. So, you know, on imaging studies, for example, there are many findings that are ambiguous, or, you know, you're just not sure, is that really a lung nodule,

