or could it be a scar from some old infectious disease? Or, you know, these kinds of situations where you're just not certain, and then you end up perhaps performing a procedure that may not be necessary, for example. Or we have situations where we are in such a rush to get as many patients through a clinic as possible that we have failures of communication

