00:27:45.000 --> 00:28:17.000
in advance, and we are the ones who are actually supposed to be the most concerned with health. That really is the ultimate irony. Yeah. We've spent a few minutes in some ways criticizing doctors or what doctors are doing, but it's worth pointing out the current system does not so of doctors well. It turns many of them into beam counters and accountants. They spend more time during meetings with patients, staring at their computer screens, trying to figure out billing codes, fighting with insurance companies. Lots and lots of doctors are not spending that time

49
